 ## 2026-09-29 — Credit the GPU chunk timing in the configs Reference
 
 Codex verification r1 of the 8-rank merge (`a3a5cb8`, APPROVE WITH EDITS, `ops/rebuild-2026-09-29/codex/verify-merge-8rank-r1.md`) found one P3: the [[references/kaggriculture-configs-follow-isaiahs-scaling-6m-recipe|configs Reference]] kept the branch's "chunking has not been measured on the GPU" limit, which the merged [[references/model-only-sps-ceiling-bounds-per-rank-throughput|model-only SPS ceiling]] evidence contradicts (1/2/3 teacher-proxy trunk chunks counted at `e1458d2`). The limit and the description now credit that timing-only measurement and keep the numerical-correctness, production teacher-integration and config-level CPU-only gaps, matching the [[references/compiled-gemm-template-overflows-above-2-21-rows|compiled-GEMM Reference]]. The verdict, prompt, transcript and evidence directory are committed beside it. Documentation only.
